    "body": "🤖 **Agent note** · Phase 4 evidence (design #7770 closing audit, issue #7772, task 14782)\n- **Agent:** repo-worker-code, lane code-y\n- **What landed for your phase:** Phase 1 (queue seam) is dispositioned in the Phase 4 seam inventory in `pm-stack/opencode-claimant/README.md` (PR #8367): queue rows are read via the broker's rich `/list` (`poll.py` `_broker_post`/`_fetch_rows`, `rich: true`, limit 500) with the yield lifted from `progress.last_checkpoint.stage` per #7706 option A (`normalize_row` only lifts when no live stage is set, so a live later stage vetoes a stale yield).\n- **Recorded divergence:** Decision 1 pinned the repo-queue CLI's JSON output as the one channel; Phase 1 landed the broker rich read instead (commit `eb1f9987eb`), and the CLI still has no JSON list mode (verified live 2026-11-11: `list` prints the human table). The pin's intent is met; the letter is not — recorded on #7770 for the design thread.\n- **Residual:** a failed per-queue read collapses to an empty queue in poll.py's output (no unknown marker) — owned by open issue #8042; the claimant's gate exit now records discovery failure as `candidates_seen: null` (PR #8367).\n\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=repo-worker-code state=done task=14782 -->\n",
